*D9 \"Nimble\"** (86 s): raw decoys, NEW `hcfg_offset`. **D10 \"Zig Zag\"** (33 s): NEW\n166\t`has_hcfg_section`. **D11 \"D-Day\"** (36 s). **D12 \"Pascal's Wager\"** (54 s): HCFG RAW. **D13 \"Crystal Clear\"** (14 s). **D14\n167\t\"Selective Memory\"** (9 s): ObjC, `.hcfg`. **D15 \"Stripped\"** (74 s): stripped/symbolized pair, `<qualifier>_` ids. **D16 \"Wasm\n168\tUp\"** (91 s): compact/direct wasm pair, `wasm`/`wasm32` first try via the prebuilt `wasm_layout`.\n169\t**D17 \"Decoder Ring\"** (204 Qs): Ada; backfill #2; `hcfg_storage` burned ~10.9k POSTs / 3.5 h until revised to an enum.\n170\t**D18 \"Flow State\"** (T+11 s): Fortran, call-graph theme unasked. **D19 \"Jack in the Box\"** (T+2:25): GnuCOBOL + `PK19` packed\n171\toverlay; NEW `overlay_offset`/`overlay_size`; the questions spelled the stub. **D20 \"Resourceful\"** (T+49 s): Haskell + `RS20`\n172\toverlay; NEW `hcfg_resource_size`. **D21 \"Shared Custody\"** (T+1:33): OCaml loader + `.cmxs` plugin; question-named member\n173\trouting AFTER the qualifier peel (running it first dropped 26 ids).\n174\t\n175\t**D22 \"Bridge Troll\"** (T+47 s): F# dll + runtimeconfig + `FSharp.Core.dll` support member; HCFG RAW twice (\"FIRST record\n176\tthat validates\"); basenames `variant-000` -> `sample`. **D23 \"Trust Issues\"** (T+84 s): VB.NET, HCFG as PE overlay; timed modes\n177\tre-shaped values. **D24 \"Spot the Difference\"** (T+35 s): Scala twin jars `-vulnerable`/`-corrected`, the 12-id twin template\n178\t(role `<role>_format`, consensus config_*). **D25 \"Out of Bounds\"** (T+80 s): Clojure twins; Mastery 9 sets first POST\n179\tcross-wired 55 ids (`id(bytes)` caches) -> CORRECT ~2 min via localize + live worker.\n180\t\n181\t**D26 \"Crash Course\"** (312 Qs; T+76 s, 0 wrong): Groovy 4 jar + `crash/trace.json` sidecar; theme ASKED (`crash_fault_method` =\n182\tframes[0], `crash_frames_match_methods`); ~15 lines for the sidecar. Insight: read the question before reversing. **D27 \"Compiler\n183\tSays What\"