ay (container nearly always ELF64 x86-64, HCFG blob re-stored per\nlanguage); D15-D16 = \"ONE SOURCE, TWO BUILDS\" pairs with a `<qualifier>_` id prefix (`stripped`/`symbolized`, `compact`/`direct`);\nD17 Ada ELF + BACKFILL #2 (160 -> 204 ids: old days' single-solve facts re-asked on their groups + the `hcfg_storage` enum after a\nmid-day contract revision); D18 Fortran ELF (theme \"call graph / no injection\" unasked, CORRECT T+11 s). **D19 \"Jack in the Box\"\n(static-unpacking)** = ONE GnuCOBOL ELF (11 KB, `libcob.so.1`, stripped) whose HCFG is NOT in the image: a `PK19` overlay is\n7z, xxd; venv python: capstone, unicorn, angr, lief, pyelftools, pefile, dnfile, pycryptodome, pyzipper, xdis/uncompyle6/decompyle3,\nlz4, yara. Cross compilers: aarch64-linux-gnu-gcc-15, clang-18 (no lld/wasm-ld: other targets compile to `.o` only).\nMissing: qemu-user(-static), wasm-ld/lld, wasmtime, capa, Detect-It-Easy (diec), de4dot, monodis, erlang (beam_disasm),\nunluac/luajit-decompiler (luac present), blutter, srecord (srec_cat), binutils-multiarch, checksec, python zstandard/brotli, rzpipe/r2pipe.\n\n## Concept table\n\n| # | concept | status | recognition cues | standard tool + exact command | D20+ likelihood |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | C ELF (gcc, glibc) | seen D1, D15 (+ every day's d01; D17 re-asked marker/recover_code) | `GCC: (...)` in `.comment`, `.interp` ld-linux, `__libc_start_main` | [I] `readelf -hSW f; readelf -sW f; objdump -d -M intel f` | high (carry-over every day; mastery d01 re-rolls stripped/renamed) |\n| 2 | C++ Itanium ELF / MinGW PE32+ | seen D2 | `_Z` symbols, `_ZTV`/`_ZTI`/`_ZTS`, `libstdc++`; PE `.text$_Z...` COMDAT, `.CRT`, `.tls` | [I] `nm -C f`; `objdump -t f.exe`; `c++filt` | high (carry-over; ELF/PE re-rolls per member) |\n| 3 | .NET C# / F# / VB.NET PE (pe_cli) | seen D3 (C#), D22 (F#: FSharp.Core dependency member), **D23 (VB.NET: `Microsoft.VisualBasic.Core` AssemblyRef, `StandardModuleAttribute`, `VB$AnonymousType_N`; 8 KB, HCFG RAW