oad order NOT asked.","+- **Bonus \"SHA1-Hulud\"** (flag crackme, see header): our 4 worker launches (~1 h 45 min, 0 wrong submits) did not get the flag;","+  a reviewer's manual analysis solved it in ~5 min (CORRECT T+2:20 from release). Lost time: an emulator with \"clean = not found\"","+  env stubs ran to completion SILENTLY on every input (env answers feed the keys -> poisoned target), read as \"gate bailed\";","+  25 min modelling SHA-1 stub variants that only needed to execute; byte-at-a-time attack defeated by the backwards second pass."," ","-**D28 \"Family Resemblance\"** (slug `family-clustering`; 392 Qs; **CORRECT T+3:23, 6 rejected POSTs (4 batches + 2 single-id)**; TT 54 s / Mastery","-12 sets (4704 ids) CORRECT first POST).","-- Artifact: an Odin ELF TRIO in archive order `d28--sample-false-friend.elf`, `-family-a.elf`, `-family-b.elf` (~22.9 KB each,","-  glibc PIE, stripped, identical section table). a vs b differ in ONE byte (role string); the false friend differs in ~2k bytes","-  from `.text` on and carries its own valid HCFG (campaign `FF28-`). HCFG RAW appended at e_shoff+e_shnum*64 in all three.","-- 14 new ids: 3 sha256, `<role>_format`/`<role>_machine` for `false_friend`/`family_a`/`family_b` (integer 62), 4 unqualified","-  config_* = consensus of family-a + family-b (\"do not use false-friend.elf\"), `false_friend_config_campaign`. The cluster/","-  similarity theme itself was NOT asked beyond that routing.","-- BACKFILL #3 was the real work: 54 new spec-worded ids padded d01-d27 to 14 each (see Variant axes). The D27 solver answered","-  361/392; the race harness banked 324 carried-over ids at T+1:06 and 36 more by T+1:23 (bisected batches); a worker added","-  the 31 missing fields (generic spec-grammar fallback) and POSTed at T+2:34; last id at T+3:23.","-- Lost time: four all-or-nothing batches sank on ONE wrong backfill field each -- d20 `overlay_size` (generic `<2 caps><2","-  digits>` match -> 19; right = len - rfind(`RS20`) = 463) 